Package: neximageeditor
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         webp-pixbuf-loader
Description: Layer-based image editor written in C++17 and GTK 4
 NexImageEditor is a lightweight raster image editor with a GIMP-style layout:
 menu bar, toolbox, tool options bar, document tabs, a rulers-and-canvas view,
 and Colour, Layers and History panels with a status bar. It supports rectangle,
 ellipse, lasso and magic wand selections, move (including selected pixels),
 brush, eraser, bucket fill, gradients, eyedropper, crop, free transform, raster
 text and shapes, undo/redo, layer blend modes and opacity, colour adjustments,
 filters with live preview, canvas and image size, rotate and flip, and
 PNG/JPEG/WebP/BMP/TIFF import and export, plus its own .nxe project format.
